{
 "translation": "One day, while bathing, a Muslim madman shouted \"Pakistan Zindabad!\" so loudly that he slipped on the floor and fell unconscious. There were also many madmen who were not mad. Among them, a larger number were murderers whose relatives had bribed officials to send them to the asylum to escape the gallows. These people somewhat understood why India was partitioned and what Pakistan was, but they too were unaware of the exact events. Nothing could be learned from newspapers, and the guard-soldiers were illiterate and foolish. No conclusion could be drawn from their conversations either. They only knew that there was a man named Muhammad Ali Jinnah, who was called Quaid-e-Azam. He had created a separate country for Muslims, named Pakistan. Where it was, or how far it spread, they knew nothing about it. This was why all those madmen in the asylum whose minds were not completely ruined were in a dilemma as to whether they were in India or Pakistan. If they are in India, then where is Pakistan? And if they are in Pakistan, then how is it possible that a short while ago they were also in India while living right here? One madman became so entangled in the India-Pakistan, India-Pakistan cycle that he became even crazier. While sweeping, one day he climbed a tree and, sitting on a branch, continuously gave a speech for two hours, which was on the serious problem of Pakistan and India. When the guards told him to come down, he climbed even higher. When he was threatened, he said, \"I don't want to live in India, nor in Pakistan. I will live right here on this tree.\" After great difficulty, when his fit subsided, he came down and started crying, embracing his Hindu and Sikh friends again and again. His heart was filled with this thought that they would leave him and go to India. One M.Sc. An M.Sc. radio engineer, who was Muslim, and completely isolated from the other lunatics, used to quietly stroll all day long on a particular path in the garden. This change became apparent when he took off all his clothes and handed them over to the warder, and started walking around the entire garden stark naked.",
